an\": \"E4 is an electrical one\"},\n{\"text\": \"E2 and E4 are escalated differently.\", \"line\": 6, \"span\": \"they are\\nescalated differently\"},\n{\"text\": \"To clear E2 in the field, you free the pin with the service key.\", \"line\": 11, \"span\": \"Free the pin with the service key\"},\n{\"text\": \"To clear E2 in the field, you cycle the dock twice.\", \"line\": 11, \"span\": \"cycle the dock twice\"},\n{\"text\": \"If the dock takes a bike and releases it on both cycles, you close the fault on your handheld.\", \"line\": 11, \"span\": \"If the dock takes a\\nbike and releases it on both cycles, close the fault on your handheld\"},\n{\"text\": \"E2 is escalated to the workshop after 2 failed attempts.\", \"line\": 16, \"span\": \"Escalate E2 to the workshop after 2 failed attempts\"},\n{\"text\": \"You should not keep cycling a dock that has failed twice.\", \"line\": 16, \"span\": \"Do not keep cycling a dock\\nthat has failed twice\"},\n{\"text\": \"Repeated forcing bends the pin.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"repeated forcing bends the pin\"},\n{\"text\": \"Repeated forcing turns a 20 minute workshop job into a replacement.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"turns a 20 minute\\nworkshop job into a replacement\"},\n{\"text\": \"E4 is never a field fix.\", \"line\": 20, \"span\": \"E4 is never a field fix\"},\n{\"text\": \"E4 is reported to the electrical contractor the same day.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"Report E4 to the electrical contractor the same day\"},\n{\"text\": \"Field crew do not open the power enclosure under any circumstances.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"Field crew do not open the\\npower enclosure under any circumstances\"},\n{\"text\": \"A station with more than half its docks faulted is taken out of service in the app.\", \"line\": 27, \"span\": \"A station with more than half its docks faulted is taken out of service in the\\napp\"},\n{\"text\": \"The support desk is told before taking a station out of service, not after.\", \"line\": 28, \"span\": \"Tell the support desk before you do this, not after\"}\n]}","ttft_ms":6801,"type":"result","duration_ms":6841,"uuid":"b9e89884-e2e8-4160-bbb6-3f1021a6b050","ttft_stream_ms":1216,"time_to_request_ms":111,"first_content_frame_ms":1216,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
